      "id": "claim_1bb28160faae4bc38543ad3167a3616e",
      "statement": "Signature verification requires the X-Hub-Signature-256 header to match ^sha256=[a-f0-9]{64}$ and compares the HMAC-sha256 of the raw body against it with crypto.timingSafeEqual (constant-time), rejecting with 401 GITHUB_WEBHOOK_SIGNATURE_INVALID.",
