      "statement": "The issues branch only accepts actions opened and labeled (zod issuePayload); a labeled event is ignored with 202 label_not_selected unless the label equals GITHUB_LOOP_LABEL (default djimitflo), and unsupported X-GitHub-Event types get 202 ignored/unsupported_event.",
