    {
      "id": "claim_d447c7c81baf4814a3b8df0cbfe08509",
      "statement": "Issue intake imports exactly one triaged work item via IntegrationInboxService.importEvent (source github_issue, recommended_loop repo-maintenance-loop, value_score default 85 for github_issue), wraps issue content in a BEGIN_EXTERNAL_CONTENT trust=untrusted fence as a prompt-injection defense, derives risk_class from labels (critical/sev1/p0→critical, high/sev2/p1→high, medium/p2→medium, else low), and responds execution_started: false with operator_review_required: true — the connector never starts goals, loops, or workers for issues.",
