    {
      "id": "claim_e6b80f4a43744c2db11d425f895613e3",
      "statement": "The pull_request branch (actions opened/synchronize/reopened) runs a single immediate SQLite transaction that creates a goal with the untrusted-content-wrapped objective, starts a repo-maintenance-loop run whose target_finding file_path is a stable anchor file (first present of package.json/README.md/AGENTS.md, else 422 GITHUB_WEBHOOK_NO_ANCHOR_FILE), and records the delivery; GithubPrReviewService.startReview is called only after the transaction commits because shelling to gh must never happen inside it.",
