      "id": "claim_02bcd559157141839dbec98c27bad74f",
      "statement": "Phase 1 (default, no LLM) synthesizes an already-completed manual maker lease (the PR's commits are the patch, no worktree) and a manual checker lease driving the real LoopService.submitCheckerVerdict with a manual_attestation; the verdict is a rule-based stub over gh pr view stats — >40 files or >1500 changed lines or paths matching /.env|secret|credential/i yield needs_revision, otherwise accepted — and the worktree-less loop_run settling as blocked is expected since the GitHub-posted verdict is computed independently.",
