      "statement": "Phase 2 (opt-in via GITHUB_PR_REVIEW_RUNTIME set to codex/opencode/claude/gemini/editor/mock) returns pending immediately and asynchronously fetches pull/<n>/head, materializes a real worktree on a djimitflo/pr-review branch reset to the head SHA, writes gh pr diff into .djimitflo/PR_REVIEW_PACKET.md wrapped as untrusted external content, and drives a real checker through LoopService.executeChecker with a 480s timeout; it is off by default to avoid auto-spawning paid LLM calls on every PR push.",
